The OpenMP runtime

The Windows runtime zips include the LLVM OpenMP runtime (libomp.dll), which the runtime's CPU code loads. It is
distributed under the Apache License v2.0 with LLVM Exceptions; its licence ships next to it as LICENSE-LLVM-OpenMP.

The CUDA runtime libraries

The CUDA build of the runtime loads NVIDIA's CUDA runtime libraries. They are NVIDIA's, are not part of
this repository and are not included in the runtime zips; install them separately.
